Template: foldertoiso/context-menu
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Add 'Create ISO with FolderToISO' to folder context menus?
 Enable folder actions in GNOME Files (Nautilus), Nemo, Dolphin, and Thunar's
 Send To menu. Actions open FolderToISO with the selected folder and ISO path
 filled in. You may need to restart your file manager or sign in again.
 .
 This is optional and disabled by default. You can change it later by running
 sudo dpkg-reconfigure foldertoiso.
